# GS-011: A late stopper cannot recover gas that already escaped
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CO2 0.001mol
wait 60s
seal v1 100mL
new
add v2 water 100mL
seal v2 100mL
add v2 CO2 0.001mol
wait 60s
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
